    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11914" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερί-γρᾰφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not rounded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιόδου βάσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not circumscribed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.5
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				71
			</span></i>; <i>undetermined,</i> of time, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>unlimited,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.79
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.47
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.396H.
			</span></i></div>
